    "summary": "The Orange Alignment is something Hjumpik got involved with in the Feywild, connected to the Orange Oracle and the Corvinarus family's dimensional manipulations. Waluigi doesn't fully understand what the Orange Alignment IS, but it seems to involve Hjumpik serving as some kind of agent or participant in plans that span multiple timelines and realities. Waluigi finds interdimensional mysticism EXHAUSTING to research.",
    "description": "Waluigi is writing this entry with the disclaimer that Waluigi does NOT fully understand what the Orange Alignment is. Hjumpik knows more. The Oracle knows more. Waluigi is working from fragments, rumors, and the general sense that something IMPORTANT is happening that involves orange robes and cosmic significance.\n\n## What Waluigi Knows\n\nThe Orange Alignment appears to be a faction, philosophy, or cosmic arrangement connected to the Oracle—specifically the 'Orange Oracle' iteration encountered in the Feywild. The color orange is SIGNIFICANT in ways that Waluigi doesn't fully grasp but keeps appearing in contexts related to the Corvinarus family, dimensional manipulation, and prophecy.\n\nHjumpik became involved with the Orange Alignment during the Feywild displacement following the Planar Fracture. His exact role is unclear—participant? Agent? Chosen representative? The terminology varies depending on who's explaining.\n\n## Connection to the Corvinarus Family\n\nThe Corvinarus family uses color-coding for their various branches and dimensional iterations. Orange appears connected to specific prophecies, bloodline branches, or cosmic functions. The Grafting ritual in 988 BF involved orange-robed figures. The Oracle wears orange. Something about the color MATTERS in their metaphysical framework.\n\nWaluigi has written elsewhere about the Corvinarus family's dimensional spanning and the 'Three Threads' prophecy. The Orange Alignment seems to be one of those threads—or adjacent to them in ways that Waluigi's non-mystical brain struggles to map.\n\n## Hjumpik's Role\n\nHjumpik accepted some kind of role or responsibility within the Orange Alignment. Waluigi respects Hjumpik's work ethic even when Waluigi doesn't understand his motivations. If Hjumpik committed to something, he'll see it through—that's just who Hjumpik is.\n\nWhat that commitment MEANS in practical terms remains unclear. Does Hjumpik have obligations? Powers? Access to information? The answers probably exist but Waluigi hasn't extracted them yet.\n\n## Assessment\n\nWaluigi's honest assessment is that the Orange Alignment is ABOVE his pay grade. Dimensional mysticism, color-coded cosmic factions, prophetic frameworks—this is territory where Waluigi's practical skills are less useful than someone who actually studied magical theory.\n\nWhat Waluigi CAN say is that the Orange Alignment is REAL, it's ACTIVE, and Hjumpik is connected to it. Whatever plans the Orange Oracle has, Hjumpik is part of them. Whether that's good or bad depends on factors Waluigi doesn't have enough information to evaluate.\n\nWaluigi will update this entry when he learns more. For now, he's noting its existence and Hjumpik's involvement and hoping that someone who actually understands interdimensional mysticism will eventually explain things clearly.\n\nWAH.",
    "aftermath": "Ongoing. The Orange Alignment's plans continue to unfold. Hjumpik remains connected to whatever those plans are. The Oracle persists across dimensions. And Waluigi remains confused but dutiful about documenting it.",
